# yudae QEMU

QEMU 11.1.3 with the display fixes the yudae VM viewer needs.

## Build

```
mkdir build && cd build
../configure --prefix=$HOME/qemu-linux/install --target-list=x86_64-softmmu \
  --enable-kvm --enable-opengl --enable-virglrenderer --enable-dbus-display \
  --enable-vhost-user --enable-virtfs --enable-slirp \
  --disable-gtk --disable-sdl --disable-spice --disable-docs --disable-tools \
  --disable-guest-agent --disable-werror
ninja && ninja install
```

## Patch

`ui/dbus-listener.c`:

- cache dmabuf exports by texture id, size and backing size; repeat scanouts send `UpdateDMABUF` instead of re-exporting the texture
- route pixman surfaces without a GL texture through `ScanoutMap`/`Update` instead of dropping them
- skip `UpdateDMABUF` for surfaces without a GL texture

## Known open

- the guest compositor stops presenting when the dbus display has no listener; a listener is required as a pump
- the viewer ack path needs a real event loop; the reference spike reaches 5-27 updates/s
